  "description": "Proposed conversion of ground floor Community Flat (class F2 (b)) to a residential unit (class C3), installation of external extractor fan vents and provision of cycle store.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding what is shown on the approved plans, detailed design of the secure parking for 3 cycles serving the development site shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority prior the first occupation of the development hereby approved. The approved details shall be implemented prior to the first occupation of the development, and maintained and retained thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that a reasonable provision is made within the site for the parking of bicycles in the interest of relieving congestion in surrounding streets and improving highway conditions in general.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
